{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "antfly-grep private workspace request v1",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "version",
    "id",
    "op"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "version": {
      "const": 1
    },
    "id": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 0,
      "maximum": 18446744073709551615
    },
    "op": {
      "enum": [
        "search",
        "invalidate",
        "refresh",
        "trim",
        "close",
        "register",
        "forget"
      ]
    },
    "revision": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ],
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
    },
    "args": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "if_result_token": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ],
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
    },
    "force_rescan": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": false
    },
    "query_handle": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ],
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
    },
    "compact": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": true
    },
    "delta": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": false
    }
  },
  "allOf": [
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "op": {
            "const": "search"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "revision"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "revision": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "if_result_token"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "if_result_token": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "op": {
            "const": "search"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "force_rescan"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "force_rescan": {
            "const": true
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "op": {
            "const": "refresh"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "query_handle"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "query_handle": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "op": {
            "enum": [
              "search",
              "forget"
            ]
          },
          "args": {
            "maxItems": 0
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "op": {
            "const": "forget"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "query_handle"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "query_handle": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "delta"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "delta": {
            "const": true
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "query_handle",
          "if_result_token"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "op": {
            "const": "search"
          },
          "query_handle": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "if_result_token": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "$comment": "Each UTF-8 JSON request occupies at most 65535 bytes before LF. Requests execute serially. Search revision must equal the current non-invalidated workspace_ready revision. Refresh is transactional and a failed refresh leaves the session invalidated. Trim releases optional process-local caches, provider resources, and idle workers; it preserves the source snapshot and invalidated state. Search may supply if_result_token; a valid complete cache hit can emit workspace_unchanged instead of result rows, followed by fresh summary/end. Tokens expire with all evidence and are process-local. Refresh force_rescan discards optional kernel witnesses and reads every eligible file. Default refresh is conservative; --workspace-watch opts into native event visibility assumptions. Register binds immutable effective options/provider credentials and compiled patterns to a bounded process-local query_handle, compact by default. Search may supply args or a handle; overrides with a handle are rejected. Forget and trim retire handles. Delta with a retained matching baseline can emit workspace_delta(order, removed) and only upserted file payloads. Clients atomically commit the new view/token only after complete summary and successful workspace_end; unknown baselines fall back to full output. Incremental state admission/coverage/TTL loss uses ordinary search."
}
